#: kio/tcpslavebase.cpp:893 kio/tcpslavebase.cpp:1018
msgid "Would you like to accept this certificate forever without being prompted?"
msgstr ""
"Voloz accepter ciste acertineure djusk' a tofer sins k' on vos dmande pus "
